sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Django service layer
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant R100 as Rater v100 (current)
    participant Q as Background queue
    participant R101 as Rater v101 (candidate)
    participant CW as CloudWatch

    D->>R100: payload (unchanged)
    R100-->>D: premiums
    D->>DB: rating_run mode=live + coverage premiums (one transaction)
    D->>Q: after commit: shadow job (same payload, rater 101)
    Q->>R101: same payload (reserved concurrency, never starves live)
    R101-->>Q: premiums
    Q->>DB: rating_run mode=shadow (never sets a premium)
    Q->>CW: ShadowDiff metric (premium_no_discount, discounted_amount, premium)
    alt any difference
        CW-->>CW: alarm, the switch is blocked
    end
    Note over D,R101: Switch = a new base program version pinning 101 on an effective date.<br/>In-flight applications stay on 100. Rollback = restore the previous base version.
